{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S06–S07、S09、S11、S13的感受说明偏长，尤其S11连续重复厚和弦、水波的描述，扫读负担高于X的短词栏。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把话中的关键转折加亮，感受缩小并按音乐节点出现，观众更容易先抓住每段主旨，再补充具体听感；X右栏虽然短，却多是并列词语，需要观众自己拼回情境。人物动机方面X的叙述更完整，例如S01明确交代害怕给对方造成负担，S10交代为何暂时不猜以后；但Y从开头悬而未说到结尾终于回应，水波、船、时间等意象持续回扣，整体连贯性和感受细腻度更强。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "60c91171-69ad-482d-bef9-cac266c93da2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T032423371303Z", "elapsed_seconds": 51.704, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:25:15.083213+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a21529807d1c123294cccc0035152a1024d258c97a9eebaaae964defeb42ee50", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_a